codex
The current fixture has only controllers and in-memory repositories. I’m adding a small order cancellation service to coordinate the two stores: it checks all shipments before making any write, which preserves the required all-or-nothing behavior. Shipment creation will consult order state only when the order exists, so unknown-order behavior remains unchanged.
